<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Renong 6-mth net 230.52 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Renong 6-mth net 230.52 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    10.6	  vs	   6.8</p>
<p>    Net profit	    230.52	 vs	 113.96</p>
<p>    Turnover		355.66	 vs	 227.79</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	331.56	 vs	 175.63</p>
<p>    Minorities     less  47.94	 vs  less  21.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Renong Bhd is an infrastructure development conglomerate, with interests in construction, engineering and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
